what are you trying to do.
a transform matrix does rotation and translation in one step. if you just want to translate, there's the translate(x y) option
0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: I was just thinking of a (possibly better, definitely simpler) way of defining the transform.  requiring the UA to handle calculating the angles, and simply defining the points for the corners.
